@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle diamond
skinparam ConditionEndStyle diamond
skinparam ActivityDiamondFontSize 11

|Warehouse Robot|
start
:Request next sub-order\nfor own warehouse aisle;
|System|
:Verify robot and assigned aisle;
if (Robot and aisle valid?) then ([yes])
  :Search pending sub-orders\nfor this aisle;
  if (Sub-order available?) then ([yes])
    :Assign sub-order to robot;
    :Send sub-order lines,\nquantities and storage locations;
    |Warehouse Robot|
    :Receive assigned sub-order;
    :Start AD23 Collect sub-order;
    stop
  else ([no])
    :Respond no sub-order available;
    |Warehouse Robot|
    :Wait for new sub-order;
    stop
  endif
else ([no])
  |System|
  :Reject request and report error;
  stop
endif
@enduml
